{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_029_02_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0c33f7a726cb39a6bbaf40692c1fa0a3d36edb35e4cb3f3a551d319422ebb871",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_d:cmd-000028:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d49b196ea13d8d7d5243f3e88926df0f0ea0bbbab708b2ccfb7c173f42e4aa3",
      "text": "生日派对当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:889b672727a1e6e50db3c86b9b219eb8228b3368da3e170d2d4d6de5b242f011",
      "text": "此番亦彰显了我等暗之同胞团之力。\n那么，吾便归去研习崭新之精炼术……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_d:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51a42ea08b1a595cb3539e46e596d52bfe6ffb919bf88e8085e8c533d1b994fd",
      "text": "啊，请等一下！我还有关于下一份工作的事想和阿斯兰先生商量，\n能请您留下来吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_d:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f86a4f06fce3413a8133d8dc1c1bf5f03e114bf80483988bed43d6d65df52dc4",
      "text": "唔，寻吾么？看来又是向世人昭示撒旦之威光\n的良机降临了。吾愿闻其详！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_d:cmd-000110:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_d:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:697dc0925f92b3cbe9db7288532240a2d3c5b24e91f528bb018667b0c9f171f8",
      "text": "嚯……天衣无缝之计划！如此一来即便在下一场试炼中，\n想必诸多光之子民亦将被染上暗夜之色。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_d:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9aae6706f288d1339e99dcbc9e973fed0f016ae824cc81138a86f24988d9ec2e",
      "text": "……啊，不好意思。来电话了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_d:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc3960d6c5d40cf69dd79d6ecd220d0310bac4fbe85f6079e011740757c50d0d",
      "text": "好的，辛苦了。我明白了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_d:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35a1876f503930fdf56b4bc27aa8991c5652c87096f7bc6ff1c00e42614fbdf6",
      "text": "阿斯兰先生。商量就先到这里，\n我们现在一起去Cafe Parade吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_d:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1fe4ae5babd866c9da8538431421eef4a1fce30a76fdb4fe77ec7792ec986ef",
      "text": "前往圣域么……？\n啊啊，吾知晓了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_d:cmd-000165:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe968d3db8d35ebfe76c2c2d0fde3ba02e8ca36547968532e0b39737cde82bab",
      "text": "来，阿斯兰先生，\n请您先推开门吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_d:cmd-000174:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95af9bd203811071b2193ec9d4486a42e5f5ebf3fa2f9d81d288cddf9123a018",
      "text": "唔……此举可是主另有深意。\n既为主之所愿……去也！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_d:cmd-000181:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb4df11f2c6cfc2915200d78744b0459b2793a90316ca8c73cc07951165559ad",
      "text": "……这、这究竟是……！？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
